abstract: >
  NeuroFM is a lightweight foundation model for individualized brain health
  estimation from T1-weighted MRI. Despite containing fewer than 11 million
  parameters, NeuroFM achieves state-of-the-art performance on brain age
  prediction, brain volume estimation, lateral ventricle volume estimation,
  and sex classification from a single scan.

